<title>USA: Rodman/Renshaw to streamline some operations.</title>
<headline>Rodman/Renshaw to streamline some operations.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw Capital Group Inc said Friday that it will streamline some of its New York-based fixed-income operations to accelerate its return to profitability.</p>
<p>The company said its investment-grade debt activity will continue to be based in Chicago.</p>
<p>Rodman &amp; Renshaw is about 70 percent owned by Abaco Casa de Bolsa SA de CV, which is a unit of Abaco Grupo Financiero of Monterrey, Mexico.</p>
